nt":"My fear is that Book of Going Westward will be the first supplement for Mummy 2e, several years from now.<br /> <br /> I'd kill to see it before then.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>Remi. she/her. game designer.","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/281-atamajakki","name":"atamajakki","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar281_2.png","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"5487"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2016-01-28T17:50:04-08:00","id":818879,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Cinder</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/mummy-the-curse/818766-now-i-really-want-a-book-of-judges?p=818791#post818791\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">I keep hearing that Mummy is doing really bad as a gameline...</div> </div> </div> </div>Weren't the core book and Book of the Deceived up as Ennies nominees for their years? The game isn't as popular as other <b>CofD</b> but I've never heard anyone say it's straight up <i>bad</i>.<br /> <br /> <div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>ArcaneArts</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/mummy-the-curse/818766-now-i-really-want-a-book-of-judges?p=818860#post818860\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">We'll see what happens when the rest of the kickstarter stuff is done.</div> </div> </div> </div>It's sad that I think this could be a joke <img src=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/images/smilies/frown.png\" border=\"0\" alt=\"\" title=\"Frown\" smilieid=\"11\" class=\"inlineimg\" /> <b>Cursed Necropolis: Rio</b> finally started moving again but those fictions will never see the light of day","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/638-reseru","name":"reseru","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar638_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1574"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2016-01-28T18:15:14-08:00","id":818897,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>reseru</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/mummy-the-curse/818766-now-i-really-want-a-book-of-judges?p=818879#post818879\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">It's sad that I think this could be a joke <img src=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/images/smilies/frown.png\" border=\"0\" alt=\"\" title=\"Frown\" smilieid=\"11\" class=\"inlineimg\" /> <b>Cursed Necropolis: Rio</b> finally started moving again but those fictions will never see the light of day</div> </div> </div> </div>Don't you believe it.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><b>Kelly R.S. Steele, Freelance Writer(Feel free to call me Kelly, Arcane, or Arc)</b><br /> The world is not beautiful, therefore it is.-Keiichi Sigsawa, Kino's Journey<br /> Feminine pronouns, please.","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/99-arcanearts","name":"ArcaneArts","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar99_2.png","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"11384"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2016-01-28T20:28:05-08:00","id":818961,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Cinder</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/mummy-the-curse/818766-now-i-really-want-a-book-of-judges?p=818791#post818791\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">I really hope we will get it eventually. It would be a a part of the picture I'd kill to see. Still, I don't know what the chances are. I keep hearing that Mummy is doing really bad as a gameline, but I've never been able to discern what's true and what's just loud negativity when it comes to this sort of things.<br /> <br /> On my part, I adore Mummy and all the published books, so the more we get, the happier I'll be</div> </div> </div> </div>I tend to take things with a grain of salt for two reasons.<br /> <br /> 1. I never expected Mummy to have the same sort of universal appeal of the &quot;Big Three &amp; Changeling.&quot; because the game is very niche and inward focused.<br /> <br /> 2. The few times I've seen people bring up Mummy in a harsh light it was folks I don't exactly trust for having unbiased and vitriol lacking commentary.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":2}],"user":{"link":"","name":"Guest","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/images/default/default_avatar_large.png","title":"","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2016-01-28T23:23:58-08:00","id":819021,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>reseru</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/mummy-the-curse/818766-now-i-really-want-a-book-of-judges?p=818879#post818879\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">Weren't the core book and Book of the Deceived up as Ennies nominees for their years? The game isn't as popular as other <b>CofD</b> but I've never heard anyone say it's straight up <i>bad</i>.</div> </div> </div> </div>It happened to me, but I'm mostly talking about sales, wherein such comments are usually followed by a remark that says we won't have any new books ever because the gameline it's selling so poorly. Then again, it's usually said by people who tend to be irrational at best and straight up toxic at worst. It's just that it keeps resurfacing and, after a while, one could not help but to wonder.<br /> <br /> <div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>TyrannicalRabbit</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/mummy-the-curse/818766-now-i-really-want-a-book-of-judges?p=818961#post818961\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\"><br /> I tend to take things with a grain of salt for two reasons.<br /> <br /> 1. I never expected Mummy to have the same sort of universal appeal of the &quot;Big Three &amp; Changeling.&quot; because the game is very niche and inward focused.<br /> <br /> 2. The few times I've seen people bring up Mummy in a harsh light it was folks I don't exactly trust for having unbiased and vitriol lacking commentary.</div> </div> </div> </div>Yeah, pretty much my approach as well.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/815620-cinder-s-comprehensive-collection-of-creations\" target=\"_blank\">Cinder's Comprehensive Collection of Creations</a> - Homebrew Hub<br /> <br /> <a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/beast-the-primordial-aa/1172470-cinder-writes-about-beast-the-primordial\" target=\"_blank\">I write about Beast: The Primordial a lot</a>","edited":{"userid":38,"user_link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/38-cinder","user":"Cinder","date":". 01-29-2016, 10:34 AM"},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/38-cinder","name":"Cinder","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar38_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1408"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2016-01-29T07:57:36-08:00","id":819248,"title":"","content":"Well we know Onyx Path is willing and eager to bring stuff to fans of <i>all</i> their games. <b>Dark Eras</b> came about so they <i>could</i> put something out for every game line, and even <b>Promethean</b> is getting a 2e update.<br /> <br /> I imagine that there'll be more freedom in the future now that <b>Chronicles of Darkness</b> is separate from <b>World of Darkness</b>. Using Kickstarter is how they were successful to begin with and we can see why: &quot;If you guys want this game will you fund it so we can justify its production? Okay, great!&quot;<br /> <br /> I guarantee we'll see more <b>Mummy</b> products beyond KS rewards within two years (which is admittedly a long wait, but fits the timeline for a 2e release, too)","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/638-reseru","name":"reseru","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar638_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1574"}]},"thankedby":[]}]}